[1mfw approvals[0m — Approval queue management (T-612)

Subcommands:
  pending    Show outstanding approval requests
  status     Show recent approval history (approved/rejected/expired)
  expire     Manually expire stale pending approvals (TTL: 1hr)

Approvals are created when check-tier0.sh blocks a destructive command.
They can be approved via 'fw tier0 approve' (CLI) or via Watchtower web UI.

Environment:
  Granted approvals admit the command for 300s (5 minutes) — currently resolved value.
    FW_TIER0_APPROVAL_TTL / 'fw config set TIER0_APPROVAL_TTL <s>'  sets it (both legs, CLI and Watchtower).
    TIER0_WATCHTOWER_TTL                                            legacy override, still honoured when set explicitly.
  This is the GRANT window, not the pending-request staleness window.
